WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:02.770
Our hearts are resolved!

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.480
The future of everyone is at stake!

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.080
We challenge you to a Duel, Dr. Faker!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.690
Very well. I will be your opponent.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.360
Yuma...

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.510
Good luck!

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.000
Show him your awesome 'Bring it to 'em', Yuma!

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.950
What could you guys do to me anyway?

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:42.080
Here I will crush you into pieces!

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:46.160
Stop joking! You will be the one who gets crushed!

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.610
I'll make you pay right here!

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:53.420
I'll crush you and your absurd ambitions!

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.220
Dr. Faker!

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:03.320
Very well. So you say you're opposing me?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.010
Faker!

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:21.650
Oh?!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:26.570
Oh?!

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.610
Now! I'll take the three of you on at the same time!

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.470
Get ready to lose!

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.580
Let's go!

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.990
Duel Disk, set!

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.270
Duel Mode - Photon Change!

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.560
D-Gazer - Set!

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:03.180
Duel!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.200
I am begging you... Kaito, Yuma, Shark.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:12.840
The future is in your hands!

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:21.150
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:26.700
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:43.400
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:49.100
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:53.710
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:59.530
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:04.930
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:10.210
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:16.170
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:21.580
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:26.750
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:32.190
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.580
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:44.450
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:50.660
Your shared Life will be 4000.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:56.540
The three of you will each hold 4000 Life.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.880
I'll have the first draw!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:05.220
"Number 69: The Three Heroes Unite
 One Last Duel For The Future!"

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.680
I'll show it to you. The Dueling of my soul.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:09.600
I send Garbage Ogre from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.900
to add one Garbage Lord from my deck to my hand.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:21.530
Then, by paying 1000 Life, Garbage lord can be special summoned from the hand.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.280
I special summon 3 Garbage Lords!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:27.660
What?!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.330
Appear! 3 Garbage Lords!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.010
Three monsters at once?!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.760
What are you afraid of?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.930
No... No I am not!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:47.760
It's coming!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:52.310
I overlay my 3 LV 5 Garbage Lords!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.270
I use these three Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.980
Xyz Summon!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.690
Take a good look!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.280
From all the Numbers this stands on top of, the strongest of all Numbers.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.330
Equipped with superior armor that will shock the world!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.290
This is...

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.550
Did it absorb the power of the other Numbers?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:27.180
Come forth, No. 53!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.810
Heart-Earth the Counterfeit Deity!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:39.360
A monster with 100 ATK
This is...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.780
As it happens, my Number is...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:49.030
...immune to your magic cards, traps and monster effects.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.740
I set 2 cards and end my turn!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.410
Alright! First is me!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.130
Wait, Yuma! There is something strange with the guy's Number.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.800
A 100 ATK monster, that's what it is! I'll just kick it!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.510
So you are my first opponent, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.600
Then you will be the first who gets wiped out by me!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.600
I won't let that happen!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.140
Right here with me are Shark and Kaito!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.730
And because of Astral, I gained those friends here!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.820
Astral, I'll save you for sure!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.450
My turn, draw!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.620
I summon Goblinbergh!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.210
When Goblinbergh has been summoned successfully,

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:44.670
I can special summon a LV 4 or lower monster from my hand!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.340
Appear! Gagaga Magician!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:54.680
Then I will overlay my LV 4 Goblinbergh  and Gagaga Magician!

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.390
With these 2 monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.610
Xyz Summon!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.980
Come forth! No. 39!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.700
The power of the bond between Astral and me!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.160
Aspiring Emperor Hope!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.080
So Aspiring Emperor Hope appeared.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:24.960
But at this moment I activate the permanent trap Battle Route!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.050
With this card, while I have a monster on my field,

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:34.100
the opponent's monsters in attack position have to conduct battle.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:34.930
Huh?!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.560
What does he mean?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.930
Huh? What do you mean 'What does he mean'?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.940
That monster just has 100 ATK.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.150
So... why would he activate a card that forces a battle?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.280
Oh, right!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.910
Does this mean, that he wants us to attack?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.530
Right. So if someone-

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.870
Gah, then he's beyond help!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.910
Go, Hope! Attack Heart eartH!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.000
As I thought, you are as reckless as Kazuma.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.210
Hope Sword Slash!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:15.050
Foolish... I activate the effect of Heart eartH!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.810
When this card is attacked,

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.600
I can equip it with a monster card from my graveyard!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:25.020
I equip Garbage Ogre to Heart eartH.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.230
Then Heart eartH will gain ATK

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:34.910
by the amount of the ATK of the opponent's battling monster!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.540
What?!
So this is, what it means.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.000
Even though the ATK of this Number is low,

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.960
every time it gets attacked, it still has the higher ATK than the opponent.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.550
Now Heart eartH 's ATK is 2600.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.090
Take that! Fake Burn!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:58.760
I won't let you!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:03.680
I detach one overlay unit to negate the attack!

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.810
Well done, Yuma! Go!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.530
Sure! The quick play magic Double Up Chance!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.280
This card: If the attack of a monster was negated,

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.790
it can attack once again, with its attack power doubled!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:27.250
Go, Hope! Attack Heart eartH once again!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.420
Hope Sword Double Slash!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.510
Did you see! This is <i>my</i> Hope!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:43.350
In front of me, your Hope is nothing but garbage!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.730
It will be ground to dust by me!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.270
Heart eartH's effect activates!

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:55.070
By sending the card equipped to Heart eartH to the graveyard,

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.700
it will not be destroyed!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.250
Additionally, when Heart eartH's equip card is sent to the graveyard,

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.510
half of the amount of the ATK-change will be inflicted as damage to the opponent!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:20.970
Yuma!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.770
Then I detach one overlay unit to activate Heart eartH's effect!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:34.650
The amount of damage Heart eartH inflicted to the opponent

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.110
will replenish my life points!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:37.610
What?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.240
This Number...

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.700
It also has an ability to recover life?!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.830
Heart eartH... it can raise it's ATK and evade destruction.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.130
And after being attacked, it replenishes Life Points...

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.710
This is just... the strongest of the Numbers.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:02.260
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.680
As usual , you're a botcher with dueling.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.850
But it was pretty good.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.690
Leave the rest to me.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.110
Shark.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.030
My turn, draw!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:21.530
With these fangs of mine, I will tear you into shreds! Faker!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.330
Shark?!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:26.870
Hey!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.620
I-It's nothing!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.920
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.790
<i>This is from before...</i>

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.510
What's up? Are you <i>afraid</i>, Ryouga?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:49.060
Shut up! I summon Hammer Shark!

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.440
And in this duel, I can use the power of my partner's cards!

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.940
I send all the overlay units of Hope to the graveyard!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.740
My overlay units of my Hope are...!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.320
Stop being fussy!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.820
But I...!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.700
By sending the overlay units to the graveyard,

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.870
I can special summon Xyz-Remora!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.250
When this guy is used for an Xyz-summon,

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:22.340
the materials needed for the Xyz-summon are reduced by the number of overlay units sent to the graveyard.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:23.880
What!?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:29.180
I overlay my two LV 4 Xyz-Remora and Hammer Shark!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:33.350
I build the Overlay Network with these 2 monsters!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.600
Xyz Summon!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.860
Appear, No. 32!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.820
Sea Biting Shark Drake!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.410
Yuma, your dueling gave me a hint.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:52.910
Hu?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.120
Just look!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:58.000
From my hand I activate the equip magic Shield Fin!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.550
I equip it to Aspiring Emperor Hope!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.010
Yuma, I'll borrow your Hope!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.470
Go, Hope! Attack Heart eartH!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.390
Your attack does not reach this genius of mine!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.730
I activate Heart eartH's effect!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:24.740
When this card is attacked, I can equip one monster card from the graveyard to this card.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.740
When equipped with a card by this effect,

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.620
the ATK of Heart eartH

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.460
will be increased by the original ATK of the opponent's monster!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.210
Eat this, Ryouga!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.250
Trash like you has to be melted down!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.380
Fake Burn!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.380
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.720
I activate Shield Fin's effect!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:59.770
With this card, until the end of this turn the original ATK of the equipped monster is changed to Zero,

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.400
and it can't be destroyed by battle!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:04.570
What?!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.650
Clever.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.320
He figured out the weakness of that Heart eartH.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.110
Huh?!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.700
Now the damage we get is only 100!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.250
I see!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:21.670
Because Hope's original ATK is Zero now, the ATK of Heart eartH didn't increase!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.300
That's right, Yuma.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.220
Thanks to you I could find the thing's weakness.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:33.010
Here we go! Heart eartH can use its ATK-power up only once per turn!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.890
And if the ATK has not been changed, he can not give effect damage!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.190
Roar, Shark Drake! Attack Heart eartH!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.650
Depth Bite!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:55.700
So the starving shark detected a faint smell of blood.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.540
But this kind of damage won't affect me!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.040
Heart eartH's effect activates!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:07.970
By sending the equipping card to the graveyard, this card will not be destroyed.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.850
Oh! What should we do!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:16.850
He just recovered again!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.640
It’s time to dump your hope too.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:24.230
I activate Heart eartH's monster effect!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:28.400
Once per turn I can detach 1 overlay unit,

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.490
to inflict the halved amount of damage I received to the opponent!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.530
What? Impossible!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.040
Take this! The judgment of my genius!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.420
Shark!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:47.710
Damn...

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.590
Then that guy's life recovery can be changed into an attack.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.140
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.020
I'll take over your feelings...

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.110
Kaito...

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.030
My turn, draw!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.910
Now it's <i>my</i> turn! Dr. Faker!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.120
Kaito, you are so stupid.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.620
I can't believe you'd try to defy me!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.120
I'll send you to hell for this!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.750
Stop annoying me! I will definitly beat you!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:31.880
Haruto - With these hands, I'll do anything to save you!

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.760
Haruto!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.930
I set one card!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.730
Then I summon Photon Crusher!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.350
Come forth! Photon Crusher!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:51.030
Then I special summon Photon Slayer!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.900
This card cannot be normal summoned.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.820
If there is an Xyz-monster on my side of the field,

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:00.410
I can special summon it from my hand in face-up defense position.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.830
I release Photon Crusher and Photon Slayer!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.000
Darkness within the shining galaxy...

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.380
Become the light of hope and live as my servant!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.220
The incarnation of light descends!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.220
Come forth! Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.650
Yuma's bonds with them are becoming one.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:31.190
Hope... Shark Drake... Galaxy-Eyes...

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.190
All their ace monsters are lined up.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:40.740
Now, Kaito!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.790
You idiot son, come at me!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:51.670
Kaito!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:53.510
Don't bother!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.630
I am fine...

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.630
It... How is this <i>fine</i>?

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:04.640
Seems like your body as a Number Hunter is already at its limits, Kaito.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.980
Stop the joke! This is what has become of Kaito's body for <i>your</i> sake!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.400
You're still are Kaito's dad, aren't you?!

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:13.860
Dr. Faker,

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:18.240
for your lies, me and Galaxy have stained ourselves.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.240
Now is the time to make you pay for that!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:25.000
Kaito, I wonder if you really can?

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:30.250
<i>True, if I use the effect of Shield Fin, I can inflict damage on him for certain.</i>

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:35.590
<i>But the problem is, how he will use the effect of the overlay units of Heart eartH.</i>

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:40.140
<i>Even the damage he gets, can be bounced back on us.</i>

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.350
<i>We don't stand a chance against him...!</i>

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:44.560
<i>But...</i>

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.850
Yuma, I'll borrow your monster!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.310
Sure!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.400
I'll attack Heart eartH with Aspiring Emperor Hope!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.860
Useless! When this card is attacked,

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.830
I can equip to it one monster from my graveyard!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:07.290
I will equip it with this card!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.410
Garbage Ogre!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.960
Now the ATK of Heart eartH is 2600!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.710
Take the Fake Burn!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:22.260
But now, the effect of Shield Fin, which is equipped to Hope, activates!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.260
The ATK of the equipped monster is changed to Zero,

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:28.520
and it can't be destroyed by battle!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.110
Then I attack Heart eartH with Shark Drake!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.650
So it's the same all over again!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.440
Go, Shark Drake!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.700
Depth Bite!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.330
Heart eartH's effect activates!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.170
By sending the equip card to the graveyard, destruction is prevented.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:55.170
Another effect of Heart eartH activates!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:59.970
Once per turn, I can detach 1 overlay unit,

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:05.930
to inflict half of the damage I received, in total 1350, as damage to my opponent!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:10.140
That's it! Kaito!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:14.400
Bad! Our remaining life is 1200!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.610
If this attack connects...

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.900
Now, kneel before me, Kaito!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.360
You're the only one kneeling here!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.870
Quickplay magic, Photon Prevent!

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:31.830
This card: While there is a Photon Monster on my field,

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.460
the player will not receive Effect damage!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.750
What is this?!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:40.300
Alright! And Kaito still has the attack with Galaxy-Eyes!

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.720
That guy has 2450 life remaining,

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.720
if the 3000 ATK of Galaxy-Eyes comes through...

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.980
Dr. Faker, I have followed your orders all the time!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:57.980
As a Number Hunter, I kept on hunting innocent souls.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.190
I believed in helping Haruto with this.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.700
But... all this was a lie...

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.990
You are...!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.530
I absolutely won't forgive you!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.330
For the sake of Haruto and for those many souls,

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.420
are you ready for your repentance?!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.630
Go! Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.930
Photon Stream of Destruction!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.020
Yes? Did they win?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:36.980
Yuma and them won, right?

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:42.070
We finally beat Dr. Faker with our own hands!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.110
Serves him right!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.280
Oh... What?!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:48.490
That's...

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.790
Un... unbelievable?!

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.750
Why on earth is there a new Number!?

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.990
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.620
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:11.160
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:27.300
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:32.760
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:42.310
The Number of Faker is confronting us

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:44.770
By uniting our powers, we thought we had beaten it, but

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:46.900
something unbelievable appeared in front of us!

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:49.740
What's this? Why is there a new Number?

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:51.490
Why? Faker?!

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:54.780
Yuma, there still is hope in you...

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.410
With our power and our bonds, we will absolutely defeat this guy!

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:06.290
"The Most Evil, Horrifying Dragon appears!
False Skeletal God Dragon, Heart-eartH Dragon!"

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:08.960
Who on earth... are you?

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.010
Aspiring Emperor Hope!

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:13.720
Shark Drake!

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.640
Galaxy-Eyes!

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:18.470
For these three to fight alongside each other is...

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:20.930
Go! Hope-Drake-Eyes!

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.100
I can't believe they combined together!

00:24:23.100 --> 00:24:24.270
Uh, no they didn't.
